  syv-ai/HyperQwen), bench/prompts_real.jsonl at commit bae2023ffc98753d337d2d2041784a277599a4c4, under the
  Apache License 2.0. The benchmark protocol (lab/src/lab/bench/http_chat.py) is adapted from the same
  repository's bench/run_benchmarks.sh.

