- LiveCodeBench (https://github.com/LiveCodeBench/LiveCodeBench, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024
  LiveCodeBench): its code, at a pinned commit, runs in the LiveCodeBench sandbox image, with one release file
  of the livecodebench/code_generation_lite dataset.
- bfcl-eval 2026.3.23 (Apache License 2.0), installed into the BFCL sandbox image, with its bundled test data.
- GPQA (Idavidrein/gpqa on Hugging Face, CC BY 4.0, gated). Its authors ask that the questions stay off the
  web, so this repository holds its task ids only, and runs publish scores and task ids, never question text.
